WEBVTT

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:11.690
I can't reach it.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.830
Sophie wants out of that cage!

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.870
I'm going to let Sophie out of there!

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:00.350
Your 189th warning ticket!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.830
Article #25: A little kindness can make a lot of hassle.

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:11.270
Do you really understand what getting Sophie out of that cage would entail?

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:15.410
Sophie has always wanted to be accepted the way she really is!

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:18.990
But that manager bunny doesn't care at all!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.760
Take a look at this.

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:24.450
Welcome to PriPara News.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:29.370
Houjou Sophie's 3 member team will finally be officially formed tomorrow.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.820
She will be teaming up with...

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.090
They're making a really big deal about this teamup ceremony.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:38.420
That means Sophie has already chosen life in the cage.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.140
Meddling any further would just make needless trouble for her.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:42.980
Trouble...

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:45.140
Stop thinking about that right now.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:51.730
And focus on making sure we beat her new team and win at the Grand Prix tomorrow.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.150
Win against Sophie?

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.840
We have to believe we can!

00:02:55.840 --> 00:03:00.860
Don't worry. It's a good thing we kept that Dorothy girl Kuma scouted around.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:01.940
Eh?

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.620
She's pretty good.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.620
She's already mastered our new show.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.750
Well, I'd better get going and prepare for tomorrow.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.830
Head Disciplinarian!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.360
Are you really okay with this?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.570
You saw how much Sophie wants out!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.940
I know you're actually bothered by it!

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.050
You devil! You big idiot! Calculator-head! Old pair of underpants!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.650
Good morning, Sophie.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.890
Dearest sister,

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:49.040
please prepare an extra large portion of Red Flash today.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:49.800
What?

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.470
I can't afford to fail today.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.050
I'm sorry.

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:55.640
What?

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:02.970
Sophie, I have a message from that Mireille girl who stopped by.

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:07.060
<i>But she will have to take the first step on her own.</i>

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:15.700
Sophie, whatever you choose to do,
you have my full giga-cosmic support.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.580
<i>Choose? Choose what?</i>

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:23.020
<i>What could I possibly do?</i>

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.490
Victory!

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:31.770
Success!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.130
Hurrah! Hurrah! Go for it!
We finally have a cheer squad.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.080
Hurrah! Hurrah! Go for it!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.040
Lala, you'd better win!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.960
Nao! Guys!

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:44.560
According to my calculations, your chance of victory has gone up by 200 percent.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:48.970
Objection! 300 percent. Do your best, you two!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.170
Hurrah hurrah Lala! Hurrah hurrah Mireille!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.440
Let's go, Lala.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:53.240
Okay!

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:01.880
Finally, at long last, it's the day the team is formally announced-kuma!

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.950
Doesn't get more official and formal than a 3-person team!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:11.140
Today I'm celebrating by glug-glugging this 2004 vintage Green Drink. Cheers-kuma!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.300
Dorothy will probably be here soon-pri.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.330
She's pretty good-kuma.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.790
I'm sure you'll like her too-kuma.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.630
Mireille, please wait just a bit longer!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.100
I'm going to see Sophie and talk to her one more time!

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.990
Just wait until that! Please!

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:29.600
Pop Step Gotcha! Mireille has no time for cowards-pri pri!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.070
See you later!

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:32.600
Oh come on!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.970
I don't care what you say, we're entering with Dorothy-pri!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.060
Damn it, Lala!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:42.940
So did you hear? Houjou Sophie's team is gonna be amazing!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:47.020
Yeah, yeah! They're having some crazy elaborate ceremony for the announcement!

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.690
It's gonna be all over PriPara TV.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.410
Let's go check it out!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:54.870
Uh...

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.190
Lady Sophie...

00:05:58.510 --> 00:05:59.790
Is everything all right?

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:06.740
Of course.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.070
This is the best course of action.

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:12.920
Y-Yes!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:15.140
Lady Sophie, are you really sure-chanko?

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:15.930
What?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.240
Woah!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:27.740
This is amazing! So many reporters!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.640
Houjou Sophie

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:29.800
Houjou Sophie... New team formation ceremony held here.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.390
Held Here

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:32.120
Houjou Sophie... New team formation ceremony held here.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:32.700
Held Here

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.370
Wow!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.000
Usa!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:39.960
Why are you here?

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.140
Ow!

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:44.130
Invitation only-usa!

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:49.060
Hey! Open up! Someone please open!

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:52.090
Eh? Chanko?

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.310
Are you Lady Sophie's ally-chanko?

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.520
What? Of course!

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:19.680
Ahem. I, the number one scout mascot, Usagi,

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:21.710
will present to the world with great confidence

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:27.420
the formation ceremony of the world's greatest idol team-usa!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.380
Coming to you from the formation ceremony of Houjou Sophie's team.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:37.570
The seats are packed, and the tension is almost palpable.

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:40.310
A huge combination of a Popular rank idol with Familiar rank idols

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:45.400
It looks as though the winner of the Grand Prix is as good as decided.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.650
And now, introductions from the members-usa!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.450
I'm New!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.310
And I'm Mew!

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:56.400
And together we are NEW&MEW!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.880
And in the center is, of course...

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.370
And the team name is: SOPHISTEE!

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.680
And the team name is: SOPHISTEE!
And the team name is: SOPHISTEE!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:28.690
Sophisticated! Meaning you can look forward to a more refined Sophie than ever before-usa!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.360
What's that supposed to be? Where are our names in that?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.770
Of course your names are also represented!

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:38.370
It's truly a thing of beauty.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.130
That's it?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.830
We're totally just secondaries here.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:45.790
Even though we have meowch more PriPara experience than her.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:49.340
Well, whatever. She can't actually outshine us once the group is finalized.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.760
They've got another thing coming if they think we'll be sidelined that easily.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:57.630
Now, another round of applause for our new team!

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.930
I can really hold my ears up in pride now-usa!

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.390
Amazing.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.690
That's the perfect team-pri.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.950
On a totally different level than the other teams-pri.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.300
I don't like it-kuma.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.200
If Sophie joins that team...

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:18.120
She's going to need a bunch more pickled plums,
and might end up with high blood pressure-kuma.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.530
Knock knock!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.540
Oh, there she is now!

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.950
Welcome-kuma! To the world of kumagic!

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:26.670
It's me, Dorothy! Hi there!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.520
The day of forming our team! Kumagnificent!

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.880
We've been waiting! Finally, our third member!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.840
H-Hello.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.800
Eh?

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:38.510
This is Leona. We're twins.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.550
Twins?

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.940
So once again, greetings on behalf of both of us.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.730
That's not what we heard-pri!

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.570
The Grand Prix Live is for three person teams-pri!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.900
We need just one of you or no one's getting in-pri!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.500
Leona and me is a two-in-one deal.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.450
Oh, I see!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:02.170
One plus one is one... Like heck-pri!

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:05.080
Two-pri! And two plus two is four-pri!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.620
It's three or nothing-kuma!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.460
Two-in-<i>one!</i>

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.940
Disqualified!

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:12.000
Why can't you drop one of yours?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:12.940
Double disqualified!

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:13.590
Hey, wait!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.970
And now at last, the true proof of team formation.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.610
The Friend Ticket Ceremony!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:27.020
<i>But she will have to take the first step on her own.</i>

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:30.480
<i>Choose? What's there to choose?</i>

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:34.570
<i>I'll always be useless old Sophie.</i>

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.740
<i>I gotta do something! I gotta do something!</i>

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.890
<i>But what should I do?</i>

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.970
Here you go, Sophie.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.380
And here you go, New and Mew.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.420
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.410
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.300
Paradise: Our goal.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:04.220
We swear to stand on stage as one.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:31.840
Disqualified?

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:32.790
Kuma!

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.250
It is an event for 3 person teams.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.700
Pri-please! Couldn't you just turn a blind eye this time?

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:42.800
It's an issue with the system itself, so I have no control there.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.170
No way-pri. No way-pri.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:51.190
Mireille...

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:58.330
All my plotting and calculations for this event,
the months of hard work...

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.370
Mireille...

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:01.690
It was all for nothing-pri...

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:03.840
Mireille, don't cry-kuma.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.260
You're making me all teary-eyed here-kuma.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:09.040
Wanna hibernate together? Come on, hibernation?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:13.670
No good-kuma. No comeback-kuma.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.510
Capisce!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.040
Sophie! Is this really what you want to do?

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.620
You! When did you—Get her off stage! Hurry up and get her out of here-usa!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.100
Guards!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.100
Get out-panda! Get out-panda!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.020
W-Wait!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.980
Sophie, we'll be on floor eleven!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.510
Floor eleven!

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.660
Owie ouch owzers...

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.520
What was that?

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.620
Commercial!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.070
Cut to a commercial!

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:49.080
Part of the show?

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.120
Oh dear.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.590
Once you get popular like Sophie, it's quite a hassle to deal with all the weird fans-usa.

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:59.180
Well, let's not let that stop the climax of our team formation ceremony!

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:03.010
On with the Friend Ticket Ceremony-usa!

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:14.160
Mireille, meet me on floor eleven!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.440
Lala? No point. It's over.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.470
Floor eleven!

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:21.400
Didn't you hear? It's over.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:25.900
What is? It's not over! I'm not giving up before the end!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:33.120
You gave that message to Sophie because you wanted her to leave her cage too, right?

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:35.510
Of course.

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.330
But it doesn't matter anymore.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.880
It <i>does</i> matter!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:43.170
Didn't you tell me it's one of an idol's duties to make her friends smile too!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.550
Please! I'll be waiting on floor eleven!

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.510
For you and for Sophie!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.960
I believe in you both!

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:07.360
Sophie? Hey, Sophie, what's up?

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.200
I'm sorry!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.040
Eh?

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.810
Usa!?

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.030
Guards!

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.500
Guardian Shift!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.450
You! Aren't you on Mr. Usagi's side?

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.300
What do you mean-chanko?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.830
You hate useless old Sophie, don't you?

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:45.900
She embarrasses you.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.360
We quite like her!

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:52.620
We lost sight of what would truly make you happy, Lady Sophie,

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.830
but we've finally opened our eyes!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.250
We're the Guardians sworn to protect Lady Sophie!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.210
Please go wherever you truly want!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.920
Show us the idol you really are!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:04.070
Bring it on!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.680
Thank you!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.720
Lady Cosmo, Sophie did it-chanko!

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:12.680
She did?

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.100
Pshu...

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:26.070
Eleven... Eleven...

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.010
Lala! Mireille!

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:04.080
Sophie!

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.580
You did it-pri!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:10.860
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.780
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.990
Paradise: Our goal.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.710
We swear to stand on stage as one.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.170
With this you're eligible.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.980
What have you done-usa?

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:34.180
Shut up-kuma!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:34.960
What will happen to my career-usa?

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:35.760
Abandoned by your star, you failure of a scout!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.470
My credibility! My future! My career! Ah! My me mine me me me...

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.420
Shut up, you snotball of a rabbit!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.690
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.940
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.990
Coord Change Start!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.910
Holic Trick's Pirate Pinky Dress.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.080
Pink, but with a cool design. A cute-cool coord.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.030
Pirates Pinky Dress!

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.810
The Pirates Lady Dress.

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:18.250
An air of aristocratic refinement, but with an powerful pirate twist.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.010
Pirate Lady Dress! Pri!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.850
The Pirate Royal Dress.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:29.830
This matching set of outfits is sure to give that extra bit of unity to the new team.

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.750
Pirate Royal Dress!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:45.500
Pretty Paradise!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:58.430
Yes! We can make dream!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.010
It's Houjou Sophie!

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:32.180
She teamed up with Lala and Mireille?

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:33.460
Whoa! Didn't see that coming!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.920
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:15.940
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:19.740
Cyalume Change!

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:28.500
This is great!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.210
So good!

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.890
They're really shining!

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:36.860
<i>Sophie, this is what you chose, so this time I'll tera-cosmically support you all the way.</i>

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.500
Lady sophie...

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:41.610
Chanko...

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:47.190
<i>This feels great!</i>

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:53.440
<i>This is so fun! This is a live performance!
This is the world of PriPara I fell in love with!</i>

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:55.910
<i>With these two, I can...</i>

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:57.880
<i>...sing more and more!</i>

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.300
<i>And dance more!</i>

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.270
We have just witnessed something extraordinary!

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:23.240
This trio that has not even been officially named blew the competition out of the water and emerged the winner!

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.340
A-Amazing.

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:29.370
They've never performed as a team, but they worked together flawlessly-kuma.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.160
We did it!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.620
H-How can this be-usa!?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.280
How could I lose to that little snotball?

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:39.590
Why? Why, Sophie?

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.590
Who do we team up with now?

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.260
Whoa! What an imposing presence!

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.720
I wouldn't even mind playing support to her!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.880
Excuse me!

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:54.230
How'd mew like to team up with us?

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.150
These three...

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.110
I think they could really overcome the Saints!

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:07.570
They could be a legend in the making-kuma!

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:19.590
Thank you. I think that was the best show I've ever had, and it's thanks to you.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:24.710
And according to all my calculations,
it's only getting more amazing from here on out-pri!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.070
It's so exciting!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:29.150
Let's become Divine Idols together!

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:30.010
But of course.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.580
Capisce!

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:10.660
We're having a solo booking following our victory!

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.930
We'll have to train extra hard!

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:13.990
What do you mean by "train"?

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.820
I've never done that.

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:17.860
Huh? Unbelievable-pri!

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:20.010
Training is very important-pri!

00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:21.160
I'll try.

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:22.960
Oh, I feel a bit...

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.170
I need a rest.

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.630
We haven't even done anything yet-pri!

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:28.780
Pshu...

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:29.560
Next time:

00:23:29.560 --> 00:23:32.640
Look At The Sky And Laughy
Team Name Announcement!

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.970
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
